@startuml
title Просмотр карты с территориями

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant MapUI as "MapPage (Flutter UI)"
participant Geo as "Geolocator (GPS SDK)"
participant TerrProv as "territoriesForBboxProvider"
participant TerrUC as "GetTerritoriesForBboxUseCase"
participant TerrRepo as "TerritoriesRepositoryImpl"
participant TerrApi as "TerritoriesApi"
participant NotifApi as "NotificationsApi"
participant API as "FastAPI backend"
database DB as "PostgreSQL + PostGIS"
participant OSM as "OSM Tile Server"

User -> MapUI: Открывает экран карты
MapUI -> Geo: getCurrentPosition()
Geo --> MapUI: lat/lng текущей позиции

MapUI -> MapUI: Формирует bbox по области карты
MapUI -> TerrProv: watch(territoriesForBboxProvider(bbox))
TerrProv -> TerrUC: call(bbox)
TerrUC -> TerrRepo: fetchByBbox(minLng, minLat, maxLng, maxLat)
TerrRepo -> TerrApi: getTerritories(...)
TerrApi -> API: GET /territories?minLng&minLat&maxLng&maxLat

activate API
API -> DB: SELECT territories intersecting bbox\n+ ST_AsGeoJSON + area
DB --> API: FeatureCollection (GeoJSON)
API --> TerrApi: 200 OK + GeoJSON
deactivate API

TerrApi --> TerrRepo: json
TerrRepo -> TerrRepo: Парсит Polygon/MultiPolygon\nв domain Territory
TerrRepo --> TerrUC: List<Territory>
TerrUC --> TerrProv: List<Territory>
TerrProv --> MapUI: AsyncData(List<Territory>)

MapUI -> OSM: Запрос map tiles
OSM --> MapUI: Tile images
MapUI --> User: Отрисована карта + полигоны территорий

opt Показать последнее уведомление
  MapUI -> NotifApi: GET /notifications/last
  NotifApi -> API: GET /notifications/last
  API -> DB: SELECT user_last_notification
  DB --> API: notification or empty
  API --> NotifApi: has_notification + payload
  NotifApi --> MapUI: данные уведомления
  MapUI --> User: Баннер "у вас отжали" (если есть)
end

@enduml
